*/*.tar.gz

# No blanket src/ rule: five of these keep their Rust at <pkg>/src/, which is
# also where makepkg extracts, and ignoring it untracks the crate. The
# screensaver keeps its code under crates/, so its src/ is the extract dir and
# nothing else.
shedos-screensaver/src/

# Where makepkg leaves the source it fetched: a clone beside the PKGBUILD and
# a working copy under src/.
*/shedos-ui/
*/src/shedos-ui/
